# Transform Airports AI Council — subscription authentication
#
# New Council reports do not use provider API keys. Sign in once with each
# provider's local CLI instead:
#
#   claude auth login
#   codex login
#
# The application deliberately ignores API-key variables for model execution,
# so a forgotten shell export cannot silently switch a subscription run to
# pay-as-you-go billing. This file remains only as a migration note.
